      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "49",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakoba wayitambikili anyanindi, nindi, Pompenu dinu kulondaniyileji yimwamba kamona hanyaka yakukuminina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nindi, Pompenu mutiyi, enu anyana kaYakoba, tiyililenu kudi tata yenu Isarela.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyi Rubeni, yeyi wedi wami, yeyi wuswa wami, yeyi tachi yaŋovu jami. Yeyi kulema kwakubadika, yeyi Ŋovu yakubadika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wafulokaŋa neyi meji, hiwakabadikaku, nachina chiwayili kukadidi katata yeyi, nakushimana; mwalala wayili kukadidi kami.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ASimeyona naLevi ivumu dawu dimu; mpoku jawu jatubali hiyuma yakuzuŋa nachu madombu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyi muchima wami, bayi wuya kumpùŋayawuku; oku kwakupompelawu, eyi kulema kwami, bayi wudibomba nawuku. Muloŋa wena nakuzuwa kwawu ajahili muntu, nakudikaŋaa kwawu amuketwili ŋombi mujila wawimenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuzuwa kwawu kushiŋewitu-u, muŋa kwaswejeli; nindombu yawu, muloŋa yadiŋi yawukatu; nakayambula muYakoba, nakayipalaŋesha muIsarela.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyi Yuda, yeyi akahamekawu ana kweyi; chikasa cheyi chakekala hanshiŋu yawayilumbu jey i; anyana katata yeyi akakubandamina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yuda himwana kamutupa; eyi mwanami, wunafumi hezaŋa; hakunana, hákubulamananeyi mutupa, neyi mukaji wamutupa kwaamu; wukumuvulokahinyi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hela nkunyi yawanta hiyakafuma kudi Yudaku, hela mutondu wamukwa kuyula hiwakafuma mukachi kanyendu yinduku nichichakenzayi Shilo; yenowu diyi yamba kovwahilawu antu amumatuŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakukasila; mwana kachimbulu chindi kumuvinyu, ni mwana kachimbulu chindi wamukaji kumuvinyu wasweja kuwaha; mahinindi akuvwala nayikosi muvinyu, niyikovwelu yindi nayikosi mumashi amawundu avinyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mesu indi akakekema navinyu, nimaji indi akatooka to-o namayeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zebuluni wakashakama kuchi kumu chakaluŋalwiji; wakekala chikumu chakukuŋikila maatu; ŋinza yindi yakahita kuZidoni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isakari hichimbulu chakola, nabulamani hakachi kamayinda anyikoku; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wamweni kwakunookela nindi kwakuwahi, niituŋa nindi dadiwahi; wafukamini kuchifwiji kulonda asendi yisenda, hakwikala nduŋu wakukalakeshakudi akwawu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dani wakasompesha antu indi, neyi muchidi wumu wamuIsarela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dani wakela kapela munjila, wakela chihidi mwakuhitila antu, nakusumatututu twakawalu, nimuntu wakandamahu wakahinukila hanyima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ami natalilili wamwinu weyi, eyi Yehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gadi, chendu chawatupondu chakamulamakesha; ilaŋa yena wakalamakesha katutu kawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MuAsheri mwakafuma yakudya yindi yikweti manji; wakaleta tuyakudya twatuwahi twakudya anyanta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nafwatali hinkayi yanombuwu, wahoshaŋa mazu aweni amawahi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yosefu himwana kachikabu chasonaŋa, hichikabu chekala kukaseloki, nyitayi yindi yatandaŋa nakumotoka ikoli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akwakwasola namata anyikunji namumweshi kalula, anamwasoli, anamukabishi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwinza yena wuta windi saŋa wakolela, nimakasindi ayikolesheli, namakasa aMukwaŋovu waYakoba, nejina daKabiŋa, Ilola daIsarela, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "naNzambi yatata yeyi, diyi wakakukwashaku, naChinaweji, diyi wakakukoolekesha, nakukooleka kwakufuma muluzwizu lwamwiwulu, nakukooleka kwakufuma mwinyiŋi mwishina, nakukooleka kwamayeli nalusemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkisu jatata yeyi jinasweji ŋovu jinabadiki jawana anvwalili, jashika nikwakuma mapidi ahayanyaka; jakekala hanamutu waYosefu, mwomumbamba namutu kachi kanonwadiŋi waambuka nawana kwindi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
