              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wayikanini, wayilili nindi, Ami hiyakuntwala kwaya antaŋa jami; mwakanjiiki nawatatajami mwiyeŋu dekala mwiha dakaHiti Efwenaoni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
